@HostAddress = http://localhost:5158

### =========================================================================
### RF-01: GESTIÓN DE EMPLEADOS
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Consultar todos los empleados
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2 Consultar solo empleados activos
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees?status=Active
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.3 Registrar un nuevo empleado
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationNumber": "1044556677",
  "firstName": "María Fernanda",
  "lastName": "López Castro",
  "email": "maria.lopez@logistica-sgcae.com",
  "position": "Supervisora de Inventarios",
  "department": "Almacenamiento"
}

###

### 1.4 Actualizar información de un empleado (Reemplazar {employeeId} con un GUID real)
@employeeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María Fernanda",
  "lastName": "López Castro",
  "email": "maria.lopez@logistica-sgcae.com",
  "position": "Jefe de Bodega Nacional",
  "department": "Logística y Almacenamiento"
}

###

### 1.5 Desactivar vínculo laboral de un empleado
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees/{{employeeId}}/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### RF-02: GESTIÓN DE CREDENCIALES
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Consultar estado de credencial semilla vigente
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/credentials/CRD-2026-0001
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.2 Asignar nueva credencial a un empleado activo
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/credentials/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "code": "CRD-2026-0099"
}

###

### 2.3 Bloquear temporalmente una credencial
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/credentials/CRD-2026-0099/block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Reporte temporal de extravío en planta"
}

###

### 2.4 Desbloquear credencial
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/credentials/CRD-2026-0099/unblock
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2.5 Revocar definitivamente una credencial
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/credentials/CRD-2026-0099/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Finalización de contrato y entrega de carnet"
}

### =========================================================================
### RF-06: ADMINISTRACIÓN DE PUNTOS DE ACCESO
### =========================================================================

### 6.1 Consultar todos los puntos de acceso físicos
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-points
Accept: application/json

###

### 6.2 Consultar únicamente puntos de acceso habilitados
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-points?isEnabled=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 6.3 Registrar un nuevo punto de acceso físico
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "AP-LAB-01",
  "name": "Laboratorio de Control de Calidad",
  "area": "Planta Principal - Piso 2",
  "description": "Puerta esclusa con lector RFID",
  "isRestrictedArea": true,
  "isEnabled": true
}

### =========================================================================
### RF-03: REGISTRO DE ENTRADAS Y SALIDAS (AUTORIZADOS Y RECHAZADOS)
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Registrar movimiento de Entrada o Salida (Reemplazar accessPointId con GUID de Recepción o Bodega)
@accessPointId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-2026-0001",
  "accessPointId": "{{accessPointId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

###

### 3.2 Intento de acceso con credencial de empleado INACTIVO (Debe registrarse como Rejected)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-2026-0003",
  "accessPointId": "{{accessPointId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

###

### 3.3 Intento de acceso con credencial INEXISTENTE (Debe registrarse como Rejected)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-FALSA-9999",
  "accessPointId": "{{accessPointId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### =========================================================================
### RF-04: CONSULTA PAGINADA DEL HISTORIAL DE ACCESOS
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 Consultar historial paginado general (Página 1, 10 registros)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/history?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.2 Consultar historial filtrando solo accesos RECHAZADOS
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/history?validationResult=Rejected&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.3 Consultar historial filtrando solo accesos AUTORIZADOS
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/access-control/history?validationResult=Authorized&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
